BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mercy's Puff N Paint Series 6/12/26
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T220000
UID:260607YBzBQivdVkeS5hSe0x43xQ
DESCRIPTION:Tap into your creative flow at Mercy’s Glow Party Puff N’
  Paint—a high-vibe\, black light–lit art experience where club energy\
 , cannabis culture\, and creativity collide inside The Lounge at Mercy.\n\
 nThis isn't your average paint night: under the blacklights\, neon and glo
 w-in-the-dark paints come alive as you sip\, puff\, dance\, and create in 
 a relaxed\, yet visually electric atmosphere curated to spark imagination 
 and connection. Whether you’re dialed into your canvas or just vibing in
  the room\, this session is all about expression and good energy.\n\nWatch
  your artwork transform as the lights go low and the glow turns on as our 
 crowd favorite DJ Leori sets the vibe. Expect trippy colors\, deep bass\, 
 luminous strokes\, and a one-of-a-kind masterpiece you’ll take home at t
 he end of the night.\n\nPresented by Emerald Sky and Papa’s Herb\, this 
 experience is your invitation to slow down\, light up\, and turn elevated 
 moments into art—Mercy style.\n\nDate & Time\n\nDate: Friday\, June 12\,
  2026\n\nTime: 6:00 PM - 10:00 PM\n\nWhat’s Included\n\nAll painting sup
 plies\n\nChill\, guided creative session — zero pressure\, all fun and y
 ou get to take home your masterpiece\n\nAn atmosphere buzzing with smooth 
 evening beats\n\nA cannabis-friendly lounge to spark your creativity\n\nTi
 cket Tiers\n\nGeneral Admission - $35: Paint Supplies Only\n\nVIP Tier 1 -
  $50: Includes a 🌱$25 Goodie Bag \n\nVIP Tier 2 - $75: Includes a 🌱
 $50 Goodie Bag \n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & C
 onditions\n\nThis event is 21\\+ only. Valid government-issued ID is requi
 red for entry. By attending this event at the Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you 
 acknowledge that photography and video recording may take place. Images an
 d footage may be used by Mercy Wellness for marketing and promotional purp
 oses across various channels\, without compensation. Tickets are non-refun
 dable unless otherwise stated. Event details\, timing\, or programming are
  subject to change.\n\nCannabis consumption is limited to designated areas
  and must comply with all applicable local and state regulations. Please c
 onsume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venue\, you agree to comply with al
 l house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/mercys-puff-n-paint-series-61426-14383
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
