BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Havana Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T233000
UID:2606096vDYnP6dtU-s9Re2wlhoYw
DESCRIPTION:Let’s enjoy Havana SALSA Night! Think vibrant colors\, tro
 pical prints\, fedoras\, linen shirts\, and elegant summer dresses. Let’
 s make the room look as spectacular as the music sounds.\n\nGet Ready for 
 Havana Nights!\n\nMark Your Calendars \\(Summer Series\\)\n\nFriday\, June
  12\n\nFriday\, July 10\n\nFriday\, August 7\n\nTime: Dancing starts at 
 8:30 PM\n\nTwo Rooms\, Double the Flavor\n\nWhy settle for one style when 
 you can have both? We are featuring two dedicated rooms all night long:\n\
 nThe Salsa Room: Pure\, high-energy salsa and timba to keep you spinning.
 \n\nThe Bachata Room: Smooth\, sensual\, and modern bachata beats for you
 r favorite partner dances.\n\nFREE IF YOU TAKE CLASS THAT DAY\n\n$10 early
  bird\n\n$15 at the door.\n\nParty Details\n\nTheme: Havana Night! Think
  vibrant colors\, tropical prints\, fedoras\, linen shirts\, and elegant s
 ummer dresses. Let’s make the room look as spectacular as the music soun
 ds.\n\nDrinks: BYOB! Bring your favorite refreshments to keep you hydrat
 ed and fueled for the dance floor.\n\nCome for the music\, stay for the co
 mmunity\, and dance the summer nights away. Which date are you locking in 
 first?\n\nAddress: Salsa Dance Marin\, 4140 Redwood Hwy 8\, San Rafael
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/havana-night/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
