DESCRIPTION:Show a valid FIFA event ticket to receive 50% off the Winery E
 xclusive Flight at Whitehall Lane Winery. Wine educators guide guests thro
 ugh an elevated tasting experience in the winery or on the outdoor patio. 
 Guests will enjoy five limited-production wines from the family’s eight 
 estate vineyards\, including vineyard-designated Cabernets\, paired with a
  small cheese accompaniment.\n\nReservations can be booked through TOCK\, 
 and the promotional discount will be refunded upon arrival with a valid ev
 ent ticket! For questions\, please contact the tasting room at (707) 963-6
 454 or by email greatwine@whitehalllane.com.\n\nCharcuterie\, boxed lunche
 s\, and shareable items are available with a minimum 72-hour notice.
LOCATION:Whitehall Lane Winery
URL:https://whitehalllane.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bricoleur Vineyards Essentials Picnic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T153000
UID:260508bQ6hLWNyxkG-3I-t-8fhhQ
DESCRIPTION:Bricoleur Vineyards’ beloved Essentials Picnic pairs a b
 ottle of wine with charcuterie\, presented in a quintessential wicker bask
 et and a chic red wagon\, offering a relaxed and beautifully curated alfre
 sco wine country experience. Guests can enjoy their picnic in picturesque\
 , family- and dog-friendly settings across the estate—whether on the Pav
 ilion lawn\, beneath the trellis by the pond\, or at the picnic tables nes
 tled within the culinary and rose gardens. With exceptional wines\, thou
 ghtfully crafted foods\, and sweeping vistas\, a visit to Bricoleur Vin
 eyards offers a laid-back\, family-friendly atmosphere featuring lawn ga
 mes\, board games\, scavenger hunts\, and catch-and-release fishing.
LOCATION:Bricoleur Vineyard
URL:https://bricoleurvineyards.com/pages/visit?srsltid=AfmBOoq4MRc2MHal1tH
 0HwUmLbCHlVrPlsnizqNwrRFitw3UKui4rRJV
