BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Inspired by the Land: Art at Bothe-Napa Valley State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T160000
UID:260608TjJoLCe4pEyNaMYUPjLboA
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by the Land: Art in the Parks is a free community art
  festival held at Bothe-Napa Valley State Park during California State Par
 ks Week. This family-friendly event brings together local artists\, makers
 \, musicians\, food vendors\, and community organizations for an afternoon
  of art\, creativity\, music\, and outdoor experiences in the heart of Nap
 a Valley.\n\nExplore a pop-up art exhibit and makers market featuring orig
 inal artwork\, handmade goods\, pottery\, jewelry\, painting\, photography
 \, woodworking\, illustration\, mixed media art\, and more from local arti
 sts and creatives. Shop local art\, connect with artists\, and discover un
 ique handmade items while enjoying the natural beauty of Bothe-Napa Valley
  State Park.\n\nThroughout the day\, enjoy live music\, interactive worksh
 ops\, demonstrations\, and creative activities for all ages including wate
 rcolor painting\, tie-dye\, leaf printmaking\, face painting\, nature jour
 naling\, community art projects\, an acrylic paint-along workshop beside R
 itchey Creek\, and an Eco-Somatic Expressive Arts Walk through the redwood
 s.\n\nFood vendors include Mi Cocina\, Cheese and Crust Wood Fired Pizza\,
  and Roman Holiday Gelato.\n\nWhether you want to shop local art\, try a n
 ew creative activity\, participate in a workshop\, or simply enjoy an afte
 rnoon of art and nature\, Inspired by the Land offers a unique way to expe
 rience California’s state parks through creativity\, community\, and con
 nection.
LOCATION:Bothe-Napa Valley State Park
URL:https://www.napavalleystateparks.org/inspired-by-the-land
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
