DESCRIPTION:Are you curious about how things are looking on Scott Ranch th
 ese days\, and what has changed on the land since the Kelly Creek Protecti
 on Project obtained ownership of this historic ranching property in Petalu
 ma? Come to an open house and tour the property on June 13\, including a c
 hance to view the barn complex and ask questions! The land is currently in
  development to become an extension of Helen Putnam Regional Park.\n\nTour
 s will leave on the half hour on a first-come\, first-served basis. RSVPs 
 are strongly encouraged\, but not required.\n\nParking is limited\, so att
 endees are encouraged to carpool. Driving south on D street\, away from do
 wntown Petaluma\, after the roundabout\, the entrance is a small driveway 
 to the right\, by the red barns. Signs or volunteers will direct you.\n\nP
 lease save your spot by registering at https://bit.ly/ScottRanchOpenHouse
