 DeLoach Vineyards\n\nCathy Ladman is an award-winning stand-up comedian\, 
 writer\, and actress. She has appeared on The Tonight Show 10 times\, with
  Jimmy Fallon\, Jay Leno\, and Johnny Carson\, including the final two ann
 iversary shows of Johnny Carson’s Tonight Show. She has also appeared si
 x times on The Late Late Show with Craig Ferguson\, had her own HBO One Ni
 ght Stand special\, a Showtime special\, and numerous other television com
 edy appearances. In addition\, she was a writer for the hit television sho
 ws Roseanne and Caroline in the City.\n\nComplimentary parking on-site\n\n
 Outdoor event \n\nDoors 6:00pm  / Showtime 7:00pm\n\nAVAILABLE FOR PURCH
 ASE: \n\nA beautiful selection of wine and sparkling wine \n\nOakville C
 heese & Charcuterie trays\n\n21\\+ Event
