UID:260609e9dhMpjvgUa55HcU8D8IUw
DESCRIPTION:A successful but unhappy Japanese accountant finds the missing
  passion in his life when he begins to secretly take ballroom dance lesson
 s.\n\nShohei Sugiyama \\(Koji Yakusho\\) seems to have it all - a high-pay
 ing job as an accountant\, a beautiful home\, a caring wife and a doting d
 aughter he loves dearly. However\, he feels something is missing in his li
 fe. One day while commuting on the train he spots a beautiful woman starin
 g wistfully out a window and eventually decides to find her. His search le
 ads him head-first into the world of competitive ballroom dancing.\n\nWatc
 h trailer  here\n\nSaturday\, June 13th 4pm & 7pm Tickets are $15 For more
  information and tickets please  click here
LOCATION:Jarvis Conservatory
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RIN-eac86j0
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sea Chantey and Songs of the Sea Singalong
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T163000
UID:260609FJATpf9j6EeluTV34EFxZg
DESCRIPTION:Avast\, ye saucy sailors! Come brave the perilous waters of Po
 int Reyes and join us for a rollicking good time at Point Reyes National S
 eashore's Sea Chantey Sing-along at the Ken Patrick Visitor Center. Please
  bring your arsenal of sea chanteys\, any musical instruments you'd like\,
  and a willingness to laugh a lot! It's so much fun when audience members 
 lead shanties for the rest of us to join in on the chorus\, and leading a 
 song is encouraged! If you'd like to find a song \\(or songs\\) to share\,
  I highly recommend setting one of your online music services to a sea cha
 ntey radio station and hear what's out there! Practice lyrics! Teach the c
 horus to our audience at the singalong! Our format is informal\, mellow\, 
 and supportive\, so if you've been wanting to push your comfort edge and l
 ead a song\, this is a perfect low-pressure opportunity. If you'd rather j
 ust singalong with the chantey choruses\, that's fine too. We always have 
 a great time no matter what. This free event is for chantey singers of all
  levels. Due to the nature of sea chanteys\, there may be lyrics that are 
 not appropriate for children. Reservations not required. To be added to th
 e notification email list for future singalong dates\, please email pore\\
 _info@nps.gov For more information\, please visit: nps.gov/pore/planyourvi
 sit/calendar.htm
LOCATION:Point Reyes National Seashore
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/959267397039572/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
