BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nocino Making Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T170000
UID:260607mXc4P14EbkKHUHp_EGN7ow
DESCRIPTION:Homemade nocino is traditional treat in Italy and with the abu
 ndant walnut trees of California your own nocino should be new tradition a
 t your holiday table. Our nocino workshop is designed to help get you kick
 started with your nocino production. \n\nIn the workshop we will start by 
 harvesting the green walnuts from our English walnut tree and then return 
 to the distillery where you will select a barrel strength \\(~60% abv\\) a
 pple brandy from a selection of options that were specially selected for t
 his workshop. We will also provide you with a collection of traditional sp
 ices\, herbs\, and citrus to add to your nocino. At the end of the event y
 ou’ll be sent home with your own newborn nocino and instructions for its
  care and feeding and a one liter barrel to age the nocino and dispense it
  when its ready!
LOCATION:Ambix Spirits
URL:https://www.farmtrails.org/event/nocino-making-workshop/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
