DESCRIPTION:Meet your Headliner: Cathy Ladman Cathy Ladman is an award-win
 ning stand-up comedian\, writer\, and actress. She has appeared onThe Toni
 ght Show10 times\, with Jimmy Fallon\, Jay Leno\, and Johnny Carson\, incl
 uding the final two anniversary shows of Johnny Carson'sTonight Show. She 
 has also appeared six times onThe Late Late Showwith Craig Ferguson\, had 
 her own HBOOne Night Standspecial\, a Showtime special\, and numerous othe
 r television comedy appearances. In addition\, she was a writer for the hi
 t television showsRoseanne and Caroline in the City. What You Need to Know
  - Doors open at 6:00 PM\, and the show starts at 7:00 PM sharp \\(no entr
 y after 7:00 PM\\). - Complimentary on-site parking for your convenience. 
 - OutdoorEvent \\(Locals\, bring your comfy outdoor chair. Chairs provided
  for traveling guests\\) - Picnics are ok Available for Purchase - A selec
 tion of wine by the bottle. - Oakville Cheese & Charcuterie trays to eleva
 te your evening. Grab your tickets now for an incredible night of comedy\,
