BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Art at the Source
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T170000
UID:260610FVnHdENIiUmY_Z2R5ObC3A
DESCRIPTION:PLAN YOUR TOUR Two Weekends: JUNE 6-7 \\+ 13-14 10am - 5pm ART
  at the SOURCE Open Studios 2026 - powered by Sebastopol Center for the Ar
 ts for over 30 years! Art at the Source is a self-guided tour of artists i
 n their personal studios all over Sonoma County\, featuringa variety of ar
 t work\, such as painting and collage\, drawing\, printmaking\, photograph
 y\, glass art\, fiber arts\, sculpture\, jewelry\, and assemblage. Learn m
 ore atartatthesource.org. Connecting Sonoma County artists to collectors\,
  art lovers\, and supporters across the greater Bay Area \\+ beyond. Artis
 t keep 100% of sales from their art studios. A list of all participating a
