DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T200000
UID:260610n4zrYV_BaE6Ajk7iq2V_4g
DESCRIPTION:77th Annual Solano County Fair\n\nJoin us June 11&ndash\;14\, 
 2026 at the Solano County Fairgrounds in Vallejo for the 77th Annual Solan
 o County Fair. This year's theme\, &ldquo\;Stars\, Stripes\, and Carnival 
 Lights\,&rdquo\; celebrates America's 250th anniversary with four days of 
 carnival rides\, live entertainment\, fair food\, agricultural exhibits\, 
 livestock shows\, and interactive experiences for all ages.\n\nIn addition
  to general fair admission\, don't miss the exciting Arena Concert Series 
 featuring nightly live performances\, including Thursday's Julia Neville c
 oncert\, Friday's concert as well as the high-energy Saturday Demolition D
 erby &mdash\; both held in the Fairgrounds arena.\n\nA long-standing commu
 nity tradition\, the Solano County Fair brings together families\, friends
 \, and neighbors for a festive summer experience that showcases the region
 's rich heritage and spirit.\n\nTicket Information\n\nTickets are valid fo
 r the specific event date selected \\(Arena Concert or Demolition Derby\\)
 .\n\nEvery person entering will need a ticket.  Zero dollar tickets availa
 ble for Children under 6 available. Ages verified at the gates. \n\nPresal
 e ends at Midnight on June 10\, 2026.\n\nNo re-entry after 10:00 p.m. \\(S
 unday: no entry or re-entry after 9:00 p.m.\\).\n\nMerchandise ordered onl
 ine may be picked up at the Fair merchandise booth during event hours.\n\n
 Fair Hours\n\nThursday: 4:00 p.m. &ndash\; 10:00 p.m.\n\nFriday: 12:00 p.m
 . &ndash\; 10:00 p.m.\n\nSaturday: 12:00 p.m. &ndash\; 10:00 p.m.\n\nSunda
 y: 12:00 p.m. &ndash\; 10:00 p.m. \\(No entry or re-entry after 9:00 p.m.\
 \)\n\nParking Information\n\nParking is not included and must be purchased
  separately.\n\nADA parking is limited and available on a first-come\, fir
 st-served basis.
LOCATION:Solano County Fairgrounds
URL:https://tickets.eventhub.net/e/2026-solano-county-fair?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
