 l have both singles and couples categories\, with a $100 Community Market 
 gift card for first place and a $50 gift card for our runner-up.\n\nFrom 6
 -8pm\, Mercy & The Heartbeats will keep the party going with an evening of
  danceable favorites and big energy.\n\nWe'll also be joined by local vend
 ors and community partners including Goatlandia\, Buddy's Farm\, Ethic Cid
 er\, Goldridge Organic Farms\, Grainsong Bread\, Uproot Origin\, LaLe's Me
 diterranean\, and more. Goatlandia will even be bringing some of their goa
