DESCRIPTION:Enjoy four expressions of the classic Burgundy varietals from 
 Auteur\, Platt Vineyard\, Three Sticks and Walt. \n\nNamed after the worl
 d renowned Côte d'Or wine region in France\, "Burgun-Day at the Corner d'
 Or" is your opportunity to experience tastes from all four of these amazin
 g producers that make truly extraordinary Chardonnay & Pinot Noir.  \n\nT
 ickets include souvenir cup and the opportunity to visit each of these tas
 ting rooms in the Northwest corner of Sonoma Plaza for tastes of their ex
 ceptional wines.  \n\nStart with lunch with proof of your ticket at The S
 wiss Hotel and receive complimentary corkage on any bottle purchased from 
 the four participating wineries before the event.\n\nEnd the day with a gr
 eat dinner at El Dorado Kitchen\, where your fully stamped passport provid
 es for a complimentary amuse bouche with your meal. \\(Reservations strong
 ly recommended for our restaurant partners\\).\n\n$40/per person.  \n\nEv
 ent is rain or shine and due to the collaborative nature of the event\, al
 l purchases are final / no refunds.  By registering\, you agree to receiv
 e email communication from Auteur\, Platt Vineyard\, Three Sticks and Walt
  for future offers.
