UID:2603096fF4GmzrgkygY2rg2tsElg
DESCRIPTION:Taylor Trades is Sonoma County's premier Outdoor Market\, held
  Sundays from 7AM – 2PM. Join us at the Santa Rosa Vets Building to shop
  a curated selection of antiques\, vintage\, vinyl\, and collectibles. Enj
 oy local food options\, coffee\, and treats with FREE admission and FREE p
