UID:260610PaWlZZ2Rx0uqNsfjdRfxng
DESCRIPTION:Make yourself a small zipper pouch in this beginner friendly s
 ewing program. We will be providing all materials\, and machines but if yo
 u already have any fabric you want to use\, please feel free to bring it. 
 Provided fabric is duck cotton canvas. If you bring your own fabric it mus
 t be a natural fiber such as cotton or linen to absorb dye properly. Due t
 o a limited number of sewing machines available at the library\, registrat
