 ease let us know so we can set up the room properly to accomodate you. If 
 you have any questions\, please call the library: \\(866\\) 572-7587. You 
 must be at least 15 years old to participate in this program.  Program Sch
 edule: June 16: Dyeing fabric pieces and choosing the zipper \\(no sewing 
 yet\\) June 23: Sewing the zipper pouch
