DESCRIPTION:Get a jump start on reading at this early literacy storytime g
 eared just for toddlers using a variety of stories\, songs\, and rhymes. T
 hese activities provide a fun environment for toddlers to exercise importa
 nt motor skills and practice using their vocabulary. Children and their gr
 ownups are encouraged to engage with the stories and activities together. 
 Afterwards\, join us for Stay & Play! We'll have a variety of toys and act
 ivities available so come hang out. This program will be 20 minutes of sto
 ries and songs followed by 25 minutes of stay and play. Recommended for ch
 ildren age 18 months to 3 years and their caregivers.
