DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special afternoon celebrating the beauty and rom
 ance of David Austin® Roses!\n\nWhether you’re a longtime admirer or ju
 st discovering these iconic English roses\, this inspiring program will ex
 plore their rich history\, unforgettable fragrance\, graceful bloom forms\
 , and how to successfully grow them in your own garden. Featuring special 
 guest speaker Rebecca Koraytem of David Austin® Roses USA \\(BS & MS Hort
 iculture\; former Southern Living editor\, and award-winning writer & desi
 gner\\). \n\nProgram topics include:\n\n• The art & science of rose bre
 eding\n\n• New and notable varieties\n\n• Garden design inspiration\n\
 n• Essential care tips for thriving roses\n\n• Q&A \\+ special drawing
  to follow\n\nAll gardening levels welcome—from curious beginners to sea
 soned rosarians. Space is limited\, so reserve your seat today! sonomarose
 s.org/dar
