DESCRIPTION:Skyhaven brings a soulful mix of rock\, pop\, blues & jazz to 
 Barrel Proof Lounge’s 2nd & 3rd Thursday Happy Hours — downtown Santa 
 Rosa!\n\nSoak in smooth grooves and golden-hour vibes when Skyhaven takes 
 the stage at Barrel Proof Lounge!\n\nThis powerhouse local group blends ro
 ck\, soul\, pop\, blues\, Americana\, and jazz into a vibrant mix made for
  lovers of live music and good times. Expect lush harmonies\, rich instrum
 entation\, and plenty of rhythm to ease you into your Thursday evening.\n\
 nJoin us downtown for Happy Hour from 4–7PM with live music from 5–7PM
  \, $6 beers\, and $2 off wine and Soju cocktails.\n\n Good friends\, gre
 at tunes\, and golden-hour energy — this is what Thursdays in downtown S
 anta Rosa are all about.\n\n21+ only.  Barrel Proof Lounge\, 501 Mendoci
 no Ave\, downtown Santa Rosa.\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com**
  for all sorts of good times ahead!
