BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Sonoma County Genealogical Society's Seminar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T160000
UID:260610dtU-04_RtkKfP3FNUzQcEA
DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma County Genealogical Society Seminar\n\n With Lisa 
 Gorrell and Cindy Brennan\n\nHow to Develop a Research Plan with Lisa Gorr
 ell\n\nFinding your Railroad Ties with Cindy Brennan\n\n Saturday\, June 
 20th\n\n FREE\n\n 1:00pm—4:00pm PDT\n\n Virtual via Zoom login beginn
 ing at 12:30 p.m.\n\nIn person come by noon and enjoy some light refreshme
 nts\n\n 1:00-2:00 How to Develop a Research Plan with Lisa Gorrell\n\n Do
  you feel like your research results go in circles\, that you keep finding
  the same information\, or you have brick walls you cannot solve? Lisa wil
 l explain how to create and use a research plan which will keep you focuse
 d on your research.\n\n Lisa S. Gorrell is a Certified Genealogist and ha
 s served on boards of several genealogical societies including the Sonoma 
 County Genealogical Society.\n\n 2:00-2:30 Interactive Break\n\n 2:30-3:
 30 Finding your Railroad Ties with Cindy Brennan\n\n There are only a few
  things that are as entwined with American history as the Railroad. For ma
 ny of our ancestors\, trains represented the most profound change in their
  lifetime. New careers\, travel\, food\, medicine and products that were n
 ever available before\, were now a possibility. Join us on a virtual train
  trip to learn how your family was connected to the magic of the Railroad.
 \n\n Cindy Brennan has been an avid family history researcher for over 20
  years. Since 2009\, she has served as the editor of the Sonoma County Gen
 ealogy Society's monthly newsletter.  \n\n This meeting is held in-pers
 on at the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-Day Saints in the Cultural Hall
 \, 1725 Peterson Lane\, Santa Rosa or you can attend via Zoom.\n\n Even i
 f you are attending in person you must register at https://www.scgsonline.
 org\n\n Registration closes Friday\, June 19th
LOCATION:Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-Day Saints
URL:https://www.scgsonline.org 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
