BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sunset Strip: An Evening of Burlesque to Live Music of The Doors
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T223000
UID:260526ar71DiYfgkCcqMXQJN8PfQ
DESCRIPTION:A smoky\, sultry burlesque experience set to the live\, hypnot
 ic music of The Doors—where rock ’n’ roll meets tease and theatrical
  allure. Expect sensual choreography\, vintage glamour\, and a rebellious 
 edge\, all unfolding to iconic\, psychedelic rhythms. It’s part concert\
 , part cabaret\, and entirely unforgettable.\n\nSunset Strip is a collabor
 ation between two Sonoma County entertainment forces\; Boss Burlesque Babe
 s and Strange Daze (Music of The Doors). Strange Daze conjures the psyched
 elic\, mystical\, and heady spirit of the rock ‘n roll songs performed b
 y the legendary Doors band and the Boss Burlesque Babes provide a visual e
 mbodiment of the sensual vibe of each song\, creating a physical bridge th
 at connects choreography\, costumes and props to the music.
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/sunset-strip-an-evening
 -of-burlesque-to-live-music-of-the-doors/19007567/2026-06-20T20
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
