DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T210000
UID:260519ysJvfYJV8EiFxs9xbHPvgQ
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, June 20\, El Dorado is hosting a Pajama Party i
 n celebration of influential women in the community\, all in support of S
 onoma Valley Mentoring Alliance\, a local organization that helps youth in
  need of social and emotional support. The evening will begin with a champ
 agne welcome before settling into the cozy\, fireplace lounge with caviar 
 service and beautifully curated raw bar. Throughout the night\, guests can
  expect meaningful conversation and inspiring company\, including a few wo
 rds from Kathy Witkowicki\, founder of Sonoma Valley Mentoring Alliance\, 
 who is a respected and influential voice in the Sonoma community.\n\nAs a 
 parting gift\, each guest will receive a pair of Coyuchi pajamas\, so you 
 can take a piece of the evening home with you\, and a portion of each tick
 et \\($25\\) will support Sonoma Valley Mentoring Alliance\, making this a
  night that gives back. And the best part? Guests are encouraged to come i
 n their pajamas!
LOCATION:El Dorado Hotel & Kitchen
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/pajama-party-an-influential-womens-evenin
 g-tickets-1989123099737?aff=oddtdtcreator&utm_source=email&utm_medium=spar
 kpost&utm_campaign=postpublish
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
