 ou’ll learn how to design and install a simple drip system for your gard
 en.\n\nIn this workshop you’ll:\n\n• Learn how drip irrigation works a
 nd why it’s water-wise\n\n• Understand tubing\, emitters\, filters\, a
 nd regulators\n\n• Design a layout for your garden beds\n\n• Practice 
