DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T160000
UID:260504bctq7kCiKkmitvR6T7RTQQ
DESCRIPTION:This camp\, led by expert **Felipe Monroy\,** is perfect for 
 young tennis players who want to improve their skills. From the basics of 
 serving and volleying to advanced techniques\, this camp offers a fun and 
 supportive environment to work on individual skills\, practice team strate
 gies\, and enjoy the game.
