 to deepen their craft.\n\nDuring the workshop\, guests will:\n\nCreate a f
 lower-printed silk bandana using fresh and dried botanicals. Enjoy a mini 
 Tataki Zome \\(flower and leaf pounding\\) demonstration while pieces stea
 m. Learn about fabric preparation techniques\, including mordanting and sc
 ouring.\n\nThe workshop fee includes all materials and instruction.\n\nDet
 ails:$55 per person\, 90-minute session\, Maximum of 12 participants\, Hel
 d outdoors \\(undercover\\) at Made Local Marketplace.\n\nAdvance registra
 tion required. Space is limited\, and a minimum of four participants is re
 quired. A minimum of 72 hours’ notice is needed for partial refunds.
