UID:260309ISV4dTbMuky44TS8ZberWA
DESCRIPTION:Learn-to-Row Summer Camp Information - North Bay Rowing Club\n
 \nAt the Learn-to-Row Summer Camp\, athletes will learn the fundamentals
  of the sport both on land and on the water. They will meet current member
 s of the team who will help guide and instruct them in proper form\, and l
 earn what it means to be a part of a team. Athletes will begin instruction
  on-land learning proper boat handling and basic sculling technique\, and 
 then they will practice their skills on-water in singles and team boats th
 at holds either 2 or 4 students in a shell. Students may have the opportun
 ity to learn more about racing skills and perform short distance races at 
 the end of the week-long session.\n\nSummer camps are open to all rowers
 \, whether you're a looking to explore a new sport or simply looking for a
  fun activity! No experience is required!\n\nAthletes: 13-17 years\n\nPrer
 equisite: No experience is required!!\n\nSession Days: Monday through Fri
 day\n\nSession Times : 9:00am -12:00pm\n\nLearn To Row Session Dates: Ses
 sion 1: June 22 - 26 Session 2: July 6 - 10 Session 3: July 13 - 17 Sessio
 n 4: July 20 - 24 Session 5: July 27 - 31
LOCATION:North Bay Rowing Club
URL:https://www.northbayrowing.org/2026-summer-camps/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TAKE YOUR TIME: Oil Pintings by Sharon Eisley
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260625T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260625T170000
UID:260529t802DR0SSEC5OdVvIoAiKQ
DESCRIPTION:“Take Your Time”\n\nChange and transformation take time. I
 n her newest oil paintings Sharon Eisley explores the time as a process. B
 e it moving through grief\, re-framing your story of self\, or birthing so
 me new creation\, each painting lures you in with beautiful application th
 en holds you in time for a closer examination of our human experience. Eis
 ley's paintings are all inspired by tarot cards and her personal journey. 
 Tarot readings will be offered at the reception by @SymbolWarehouse for an
  optional small donation.\n\nOur guest artist\, Robert Benson\, will be ch
 allenging your eyes to fill in the details with his impressionist watercol
 ors.\n\nThis June 20th reception will be the FINAL art opening for Sebasto
 pol Gallery in its home of almost 20 years! This show may last only throug
 h June 2026\, then move to our new location. Or it may be up through June 
 and July. Either way\, this will be your last chance to come celebrate our
  local\, amazing group of artists at 150 N Main St.. “Take Your Time” 
 is a reminder to our collective to take our time finding and setting up ou
 r new home for all of you. I hope you can all come celebrate all the time 
 and art we shared with you in our lovely gallery.\n\nwww.sharoneisley.com
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
