UID:2512223_3Cs5qKKEy_ifNu-Vg44w
DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\n**F
 eaturing Rootstocks & The Wurst**\n\nJoin us for a lively Friday night at 
 Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in downtown Healdsburg\, 
 featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and hearty comfort food. Our M
 usic\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the upbeat\, crowd-friendly sounds of Roots
 tocks with classic German-style fare from The Wurst.\n\nRootstocks brings 
 an energetic mix of familiar favorites and feel-good tunes\, creating the 
 perfect soundtrack for a relaxed and social evening surrounded by barrels 
 and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s wines by the glass or bottle
  while The Wurst serves traditional sausages and savory sides\, made fresh
  and full of bold flavor.\n\nFriday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPl
 ease note: This is an over-21 event inside the Barrel Room. Under-21 guest
 s and leashed pets are welcome on the patio only.\n\nCome grab a seat earl
 y and enjoy a classic Sonoma County night of great music\, great wine\, an
 d great food.\n\nWine available for purchase Live music by Rootstocks Food
  by The Wurst (German-style sausages and comfort fare) Location: Longboard
  Vineyards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
LOCATION:Longboard Vineyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
