BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SONGWRITERS IN THE ROUND
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T210000
UID:260610U0zia6WoikGZW-idwMvmgw
DESCRIPTION:FOPPIANO WINERY\, in association with SECRET SONG CLUB present
 s songwriters in the round with Izzy Lilly and Dos Nikos \\(aka Finding Ni
 co and Nicco Weisskoff\\).Spend the evening at our historic barn with an i
 ntimate showcase of talented musicians\, and relax as the sun sets over th
 e Russian River Valley. Pack a picnic\, grab your friends\, and settle in 
 for a perfect summer night.\n\n✨ All ages welcome🍷 Wine on tap availa
 ble for purchase🧺 Picnic blankets \\+ low-back chairs encouraged🐶 Fr
 iendly\, leashed dogs welcome🚫 No outside alcohol🚫 No glass containe
 rs\n\nThis is a FREE event but RSVP's are encouraged.\n\nABOUT THE ARTISTS
 :\n\nIzzy Lilly is a Sebastopol native whose soulful folk-rock sound stems
  largely from her vast musical upbringing\, listening and singing along to
  everything from Heart and Fleetwood Mac to Amy Winehouse and The Chicks. 
 Izzy is currently working on her first ever EP\, set to be released later 
 this year. https://linktr.ee/izzylilly\n\nNorth Bay music fans know Nicco
  Weisskoff as a gifted singer/songwriter in the indie folk / Americana sce
 ne. He's also a member of emo hip-hop group Dog Bones and half of the Sono
 ma County duo Dos Nikos. Highly recommend for fans of Elliott Smith\, Nick
  Drake and MJ Lenderman\, https://nicco.bandcamp.com/album/sky-writing\n\
 nFinding Nico's sound stems from a lot of different influences from Jimi H
 endrix and The Black Keys to Mac DeMarco and Medium Build. Best known as t
 he frontman of the band Finding Nico\, he also teams up with Nicco Weissko
 ff as the indie rock duo Dos Nikos. https://www.instagram.com/finding.nic
 0/
LOCATION:Foppiano Winery
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/foppianovineyards/event/611005/wine-down-f
 ridays-music-at-the-foppiano-barn
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
