UID:2603164-YgLg3EpkavoZj8g9tWqw
DESCRIPTION:On the 4th Friday each month\, join us for Kate’s Café Open
  Mic!  Hosted by Juliette Valente\, Kate’s Cafe Open Mic has been the p
 lace for incredible music and connection at the Community Center for more 
 than 25 years. Kate’s Café was named in honor of renowned American folk
  singer and songwriter\, Kate Wolf.  Both aspiring and renowned musicians
 \, writers\, poets and actors come to share their new works and talents. 
 Come to share\, come to listen!\n\n If you would like to be in the line u
 p for Kate's Café Open Mic\, please email or call MC Juliette Valente at:
   j.valente@comcast.net\, or call: \\(415\\) 488-9074.
