 arships for local high school graduates.This event is hosted by the Petalu
 ma Woman's Club Foundation.\n\nCome join us for Silent Auction\, Live Musi
 c\, Best Garden Party Hat Contest and Garden Party Dining \\(Appetizers an
 d includes 2 Beverages\\)\n\nCash Bar Only\n\nAll proceeds benefit scholar
 ships for local high school graduates.
LOCATION:Historic Home of Susy Muscatell & Mike Deverell
URL:https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/garden-party-ticket
