DESCRIPTION:The International Conference on Interdisciplinary Innovations:
  Arts\, Education\, Business and Technology \\(ICAEBT-2026\\) is a global 
 hybrid event designed to bridge the gap between creative expression\, acad
 emic research\, and industrial advancement.\n\nHosted by IFERP Academy\, t
 he conference serves as a platform for researchers\, educators\, and indus
 try leaders to discuss how integrating these diverse fields can drive soci
 etal progress.
