DESCRIPTION:Mid-May to mid-July is the time when all the lavender at Bees 
 N Blooms is blooming with bright purple radiance\, and we open the farm to
  the public for Lavender Bloom Fest!\n\nLavender Bloom Fest Field Days: M
 ay 23\, May 30-31\, June 6-7\, June 13-14\, June 20\,\n\nLavender Sunset E
 venings: May\, 29\, June 5\, June 12\, June 19\, June 26\n\nJazz Days: M
 ay 24\, June 21\, and July 12\n\nLavender U-Cut Experience: June 27-28\, 
 July 4-5\, July 11. Note: July 12 is also a U-Cut day\, but is listed unde
 r Jazz Days.\n\nBring the kids\, visit the poultry palace\, play farm bing
 o\, and snap a picture in the giant lavender chair! Shop the Farm Stand an
 d visit the Bees N Blooms Nursery. Sunset evenings are special at Bees N B
 looms. Enjoy the view as the suns shines a golden light on the lavender. E
 njoy dinner with Tacos don Pepe\, then head to the labyrinth to watch the 
 sunset.
