BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Film Series at The Madrona
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T210000
UID:260610S2mQhL726Eyg5wZEvGVbeA
DESCRIPTION:The Summer Film Series at The Madrona is a thoughtfully curate
 d outdoor program in partnership with True West Film Center and a rotating
  roster of local wine partners. The experience kicked off in May and conti
 nues on the first Wednesday of each month through October\, transforming t
 he hotel’s eight-acre hillside estate into an open-air cinema set agains
 t sweeping Sonoma views.\n\nEach evening begins at golden hour\, with gues
 ts invited to settle into the lawn with a glass of local wine\, surrounded
  by lush gardens and the historic 1881 estate. Tickets are available on Op
 enTable for $61.20 per person and include event admission\, popcorn and a 
 snack\, a complimentary glass of wine from a winery partner\, personal hea
 dphones\, and cozy blankets and seating tufts designed by Northern Califor
 nian designer Erica Tavov.\n\nThe 2026 lineup leans into iconic\, feel-goo
 d films that complement the nostalgic ease of summer evenings with the fut
 ure showings listed below:\n\n·       July 1 – A League of Their 
 Own\n\n·       August 5 – Clueless\n\n·       September 2 
 – Back to the Future\n\n·       October 7 – Audience Choice: E.
 T.\, Zombieland\, or Death Becomes Her
LOCATION:The Madrona
URL:https://themadronahotel.com/summer-film-series/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
