DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T170000
UID:260610JQuwEV8OPU6vSfVR2H63VQ
DESCRIPTION:Tue\, May 5\, throughSat\, Jul 4\, 2026 FRIEND'S HOUSE communi
 ty building \\(map\\) Please feel welcome to visit between the hours of 8a
 m and 5pm. Recurring themes of light\, shadow\, and geometry unify this co
 llection. Discover the beauty in the overlooked details of modern urban de
 sign-and even decay.
LOCATION:Datoire Foundation
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/artist/sara-downing/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
