DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T180000
UID:260505tbMYrfLuLUm8CRpF18UHew
DESCRIPTION:The First Wednesday Open Mic\, hosted by The Swiss Project\, h
 as been moved to the Lucky Gardens in Vallejo. Doors open at 6:00 pm for n
 etworking\, and the open mic begins at 7:00 pm.\n\nSending prayers to the 
